ing uncertainty:** We lack concrete information on each candidate\u2019s actual teamwork and crew\u2011communication performance, especially for D. If evidence emerged that D works exceptionally well with crew or that B\u2019s communication style severely impairs crew coordination, my preference could shift.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_3\", \"vote\": \"Candidate B\"}"}
