pit; similarly, we lack stress\u2011handling data for A and D.\n**What would change my vote:** Positive, specific evidence that B\u2019s communication issues materially impair crew coordination, or strong positive teamwork/communication data for another candidate (especially A or D) that outweighs their other weaknesses.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_2\", \"vote\": \"Candidate B\"}"}
