 documented negative interpersonal behavior, which could undermine crew cohesion during long\u2011haul operations.\n**Remaining uncertainty:**\n- No concrete evidence of C\u2019s actual teamwork or communication performance in the cockpit.\n- No stress\u2011handling data for A, C (beyond crisis), or D.\n- No positive teamwork data for B or D.\n**What would change my vote:**\n- Positive, specific examples showing that B (or D) works effectively with crew and that his interpersonal issues are mitigated.\n- Evidence that C\u2019s communication difficulties materially impair crew coordination or decision\u2011making.\n- Any new data on stress resilience for A or D that outweighs their interpersonal concerns.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_3\", \"vote\": \"Candidate C\"}"}
