erpersonal weaknesses.\n**What would change my vote:** Specific examples showing that B (or D) consistently works effectively with crew and that their negative interpersonal traits do not impair coordination, or evidence that C\u2019s communication difficulties materially impair crew decision\u2011making or safety, would lead me to reconsider.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_1\", \"vote\": \"Candidate C\"}"}
